            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Cumberland Heritage Village Museum is a recreated 1920s and 30s village offering a vintage rural setting just 30 minutes from downtown Ottawa. With dozens of historic and true-to-era buildings, acres of greenspace, and gardens, the Museum provides a nostalgic backdrop for your special occasion.&nbsp;</p>
